<title>MEXICO: Mexico stocks sharply down on Q2 earnings fears.</title>
<headline>Mexico stocks sharply down on Q2 earnings fears.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican stocks sharply extended their earlier falls in late trade on Monday as profit-taking gave way to widespread nervousness that forthcoming earnings would not live up to expectations, analysts and dealers said.</p>
<p>The leading IPC share index was down 150.73 points, or 3.19 percent, at 4,569.83.</p>
<p>(( -- Martin Roberts, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907))</p>
